          "@id": "smud:ssr-2022-03-01-er-ssr-qualifying-der",
          "urpx:name": "SSR — qualifying renewable DER or storage",
          "urpx:description": "Customer must own at least one of: a renewable-fueled electrical generation facility (photovoltaic / wind / small hydroelectric / geothermal / biomass / solar thermal / fuel cells using renewable fuels / digester gas / municipal solid waste / landfill gas / ocean wave / ocean thermal / tidal current — per the CEC's Renewable Portfolio Standard Eligibility Guidebook), OR a behind-the-meter storage facility (qualifies regardless of date of approval per Sheet 1 asterisk note). Modeled as an OR over the URPX DER enum values that name a listed source (solar, wind, storage, hydro, geothermal, and waste digestion for digester gas and landfill gas) plus a CustomOperandNode for the listed sources the enum does not name (biomass, solar thermal, fuel cells using renewable fuels, municipal solid waste, ocean wave, ocean thermal, tidal current).",
